                                      class="ant-col"
                                      style="padding: 8px 8px 8px 8px;"
                                    >
                                      <div
                                        class="ant-row ant-row-no-wrap ant-row-top condition-content "
                                      >
                                        <div
                                          class="ant-col step-column"
                                        >
                                          <div
                                            class="ant-typography view-item-value"
                                          >
                                            vii.
                                          </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div
                                          class="ant-col condition-column"
                                        >
                                          <div
                                            class="ant-typography view-item-value"
                                          >
                                            During periods of heavy or persistent precipitation, work must stop if continuing the work will result in sediment delivery downstream of the immediate worksite. Measures must be taken to minimize the risk of on-going sediment delivery to the stream during the shutdown period;
                                          </div>
                                        </div>
                                      </div>
                                    </div>
                                  </div>
                                </div>
